    <node id="&quot;BEACON MILL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Beacon Mill is a Grade II listed smock mill in Benenden, Kent, England, needing restoration and out of use since 1923. It was marked on maps from 1819-43 and 1821, and operated in conjunction with Wandle Mill until 1921."</data>
